// ===========================================================================
// The star tower: interior x 19.2..48, z 65.6..94.4, roof at 25.6, entered
// from the west. A square shaft with a round opening in the roof, crossed by
// five beams that draw a pentagram against the sky, over a smaller one cut
// into the floor over lava. Both point west, at the door.
//
// Three galleries run all the way round, at 6.4, 12.8 and 19.2, 4.8 wide. The
// stairs are 2.4 wide and go up the north wall, then the south, then the north
// again, each through a well in the gallery above, so every level is a walk
// round half the room to the next stair.
// ===========================================================================

